What this licence covers
------------------------

It covers the port's own work in this repository: the game hooks, menus, mod
menu and native renderer (port/src), the tools (port/tools) and the
documentation.

It does NOT cover:

- The patches in port/patches. They modify other projects and are under the
  licences of the projects they patch: the ReXGlue SDK (BSD-3-Clause, partly
  derived from Xenia), plume (MIT) and XenosRecomp (MIT).
- The game itself. No game files, game code, art, audio or video from
  X-Men: Destiny are in this repository, and none are licensed by it. You
  need your own legally obtained copy of the game. X-Men and all related
  names and characters are trademarks of Marvel; Activision published and
  Silicon Knights developed the original game. This project is not affiliated
  with or endorsed by any of them, or by Microsoft.


